  'node-network':{title:'Distributed coordination',eyebrow:'NODE NETWORK',summary:'The design distributes sensitive knowledge and protocol work. A versioned network specification can define threshold parameters, operator visibility, and recovery behavior.',roles:['Distribute work across participants','Avoid placing complete authority with one operator','Coordinate authorization and availability'],limits:['Published parameters should define the quorum and node model.','Distribution is strengthened by an explicit collusion model.','Availability and censorship recovery benefit from clear operating rules.'],questions:['What fraction may be corrupt?','What does each operator observe?','How are liveness and membership changes managed?']},
