<section class="section"><div class="container">${sectionHead('ARCHITECTURE','A private execution layer between chains.','Explore the proposed roles, the information they handle, and the assumptions they introduce.')}<div class="arch-grid">${architecture.map((x,i)=>`<article class="arch-card"><span class="num">0${i+1}</span><h3>${x}</h3><p>${['Defines the intended action.','Provides user authorization where needed.','Limits unnecessary disclosure.','Coordinates protected requests.','Distributes protocol work.','Checks distinct conditions.','Maps to chain-specific rules.','Applies its own finality.'][i]}</p></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn secondary" href="/protocol">Explore the architecture</a></div><p class="qualifier">Simplified architecture of the original vision. Ordering and guarantees require a versioned implementation specification.</p></div></section>
